UnitAerodromeMigration::constructor
├── when the owner is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with OwnableInvalidOwner
├── when the deployer is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the v2 token is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the v2 voting escrow is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the v2 voter is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the migration opening timestamp is not week aligned
│   └── it should revert with InvalidOpen
├── when the migration opening timestamp is not in the future
│   └── it should revert with InvalidOpen
├── when the v3 token is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
├── when the v3 voting escrow is the zero address
│   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
└── when passing valid parameters
    ├── it should set the owner
    ├── it should set the shared migration configuration
    ├── it should set the V2 Minter
    ├── it should return Defeated as the epoch governor result
    ├── it should restrict each configured v2 veNFT
    ├── it should emit RestrictionsSet for each configured v2 veNFT
    ├── it should transfer the migration veNFT seed amount from the deployer
    ├── it should create the v2 migration veNFT
    ├── it should permanently lock the v2 migration veNFT
    └── it should set the Aerodrome settlement immutables

UnitAerodromeMigration::onERC721Received
├── when the caller is not the v3 voting escrow
│   └── it should revert with InvalidERC721Transfer
└── when the caller is the v3 voting escrow
    ├── when the operator is not the migration contract
    │   └── it should revert with InvalidERC721Transfer
    └── when the operator is the migration contract
        └── it should return the ERC721 receiver selector

UnitAerodromeMigration::remaining
├── when the remaining balance is zero
│   └── it should return zero
└── when the remaining balance is positive
    └── it should return the remaining balance
